{
  "info": {
    "name": "RallyDeals - Catalog Service",
    "description": "# RallyDeals Catalog Service\n\nTest collection for the catalog service, routed **through the API Gateway** (`http://localhost:8080`). The gateway must be running with `CATALOG_SERVICE_URI` pointing at the catalog service (`http://localhost:8083`).\n\n## Authentication\n\nEvery request below sends `Authorization: Bearer <JWT>`. The gateway **parses and validates** the JWT (rally-common `JwtService.parseAndValidate`; JWT is signed HMAC, not encrypted), strips it, and **injects identity headers** before forwarding:\n\n- `X-User-Id`  -> value of the JWT `sub` claim\n- `X-User-Role` -> value of the JWT roles claim\n\nThe catalog service never validates the token itself; it reads `X-User-Id` / `X-User-Role` and trusts them (they come only from the gateway).\n\nThe collection ships with **pre-generated static dev tokens** (expire 2099) in the `sellerJwt` / `buyerJwt` / `adminJwt` collection variables, signed with the canonical dev `JWT_SECRET`: `/Wepykoli0z1033egoGDdLrm3eohJiOJUxT5L/RxgV0=`. They work against the locally running gateway with no Auth Service up. To regenerate, sign an HS256 JWT with that secret, matching the `sub`/`iss`/`roles` shape `JwtService` expects:\n\n- `sellerJwt` -> sub `11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111` (a UUID, since the catalog reads `X-User-Id` as a UUID), roles `[\"SELLER\"]`\n- `buyerJwt`  -> sub `22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222`, roles `[\"BUYER\"]`\n- `adminJwt`  -> sub `33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333`, roles `[\"ADMIN\"]`\n- `iss` = `rally-auth-service`, plus `iat`/`exp`\n\n> **Note:** if you get 401s, the gateway process is running with a *different* `JWT_SECRET` than this canonical value. Restart it so it re-reads `rally-gateway/.env`.\n\n## Seed data\n\nRun the requests in order: the **Categories -> Create Category** and **Products -> Create Product** requests save their generated ids into the `categoryId` / `productId` collection variables, so later requests run end-to-end.\n\n## Notes\n\n- The tokens' `sub` must match the `sellerId` (`user-1`) and `buyerId` (`user-2`) collection variables — the create-product assertion checks `sellerId` equals `user-1`.\n- `GET /products/{id}` returns `404` for buyers/non-owners and `200` for the owning seller, `ADMIN`, or when called with an admin token.\n- `GET /products` (buyer view) only returns `APPROVED` and non-deleted products.\n- `GET /products/sellers/{sellerId}` and `GET /products/admin` include soft-deleted products by default (`includeDeleted` defaults to `true`); responses expose `deleted` / `deletedAt` so you can tell them apart.\n- Admin queue lives at `/products/admin` (see Admin Moderation folder).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "sellerId", "value": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "buyerId", "value": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "sellerJwt", "value": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMTExMTExMS0xMTExLTExMTEtMTExMS0xMTExMTExMTExMTEiLCJpc3MiOiJyYWxseS1hdXRoLXNlcnZpY2UiLCJyb2xlcyI6WyJTRUxMRVIiXSwiaWF0IjoxNzg2NDY0NDYxLCJleHAiOjQwNzA5MDg4MDB9.0CZTJXO38hOTOVFRnl2NWn0KYDAWoEPXR5ovIKlw1Ks", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "buyerJwt", "value": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIyMjIyMjIyMi0yMjIyLTIyMjItMjIyMi0yMjIyMjIyMjIyMjIiLCJpc3MiOiJyYWxseS1hdXRoLXNlcnZpY2UiLCJyb2xlcyI6WyJCVVlFUiJdLCJpYXQiOjE3ODY0NjQ0NzcsImV4cCI6NDA3MDkwODgwMH0.8gxHGHlvgZvdF8CLWTBwoFtJqiLI65-vQb3C1bUYh-s", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminJwt", "value": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIzMzMzMzMzMy0zMzMzLTMzMzMtMzMzMy0zMzMzMzMzMzMzMzMiLCJpc3MiOiJyYWxseS1hdXRoLXNlcnZpY2UiLCJyb2xlcyI6WyJBRE1JTiJdLCJpYXQiOjE3ODY0NjQ0NjEsImV4cCI6NDA3MDkwODgwMH0.KyBKAgNPsFdSRUb4bBVTiTkw1i58L8Gpl-h25SUp9Ig", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Categories",
      "description": "Category taxonomy CRUD. In production, write operations go through the gateway as an admin; these requests send an admin JWT (`{{adminJwt}}`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Category",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminJwt}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Electronics\",\n  \"description\": \"Gadgets, audio and devices\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["categories"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"201 Created\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(201));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"categoryId\", j.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List Categories",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{sellerJwt}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["categories"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"body is array\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Category by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{sellerJwt}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["categories", "{{categoryId}}"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"returns requested id\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"categoryId\")));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Category",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminJwt}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Electronics & Accessories\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["categories", "{{categoryId}}"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Category (has products -> 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminJwt}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["categories", "{{categoryId}}"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"409/400 expected while products reference it\", () => pm.expect([400, 204]).to.include(pm.response.code));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Products",
      "description": "Product lifecycle. `X-User-Id` is taken from the gateway-injected header (derived from the JWT), never from the request body (see `deal-service.md` §4.2 for the same rule).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Product (seller)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{sellerJwt}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Wireless Headphones\",\n  \"description\": \"Noise cancelling over-ear headphones\",\n  \"categoryId\": \"{{categoryId}}\",\n  \"basePrice\": 99.99,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://example.com/headphones.jpg\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"201 Created\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(201));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"starts PENDING_APPROVAL\", () => pm.expect(j.status).to.eql(\"PENDING_APPROVAL\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"sellerId from header\", () => pm.expect(j.sellerId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"sellerId\")));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"productId\", j.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Browse Products (buyer view)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{buyerJwt}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"paginated response shape\", () => { const j = pm.response.json(); pm.expect(j).to.have.property('items'); pm.expect(j).to.have.property('total'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Products (q + sort + filter)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{buyerJwt}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?q=wireless&sort=createdAt:asc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "q", "value": "wireless" },
                { "key": "sort", "value": "createdAt:asc" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Product (seller owner -> 200)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{sellerJwt}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{productId}}"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK for owner\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Product (buyer non-owner -> 404)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{buyerJwt}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{productId}}"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"404 for non-owner (product hidden)\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(404));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Product (seller)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{sellerJwt}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Wireless Headphones Pro\",\n  \"basePrice\": 129.99\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{productId}}"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"update resets to PENDING_APPROVAL\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"PENDING_APPROVAL\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Product (seller, soft delete)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{sellerJwt}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{productId}}"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"204 No Content\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(204));",
                  "pm.test(\"re-delete -> 410 Gone\", () => { pm.sendRequest({ url: pm.request.url.toString(), method: 'DELETE', header: { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + pm.collectionVariables.get('sellerJwt') } }, (e, r) => pm.expect(r.code).to.eql(410)); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List Seller Products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{sellerJwt}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/sellers/{{sellerId}}?includeDeleted=true",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "sellers", "{{sellerId}}"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "includeDeleted", "value": "true" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"items expose deleted state\", () => { const j = pm.response.json(); for (const it of j.items) { pm.expect(it).to.have.property('deleted'); pm.expect(it).to.have.property('deletedAt'); } });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Lookup Products (Order Service)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{sellerJwt}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productIds\": [\"{{productId}}\"]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/lookup",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "lookup"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"found/notFound split\", () => { const j = pm.response.json(); pm.expect(j).to.have.property('found'); pm.expect(j).to.have.property('notFound'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin Moderation",
      "description": "Moderation lifecycle. These endpoints are routed to the gateway with an admin JWT (`{{adminJwt}}`). (The docs define `/admin/products`, the implementation exposes `/products/admin`.)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Admin Queue (pending)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminJwt}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/admin?status=PENDING_APPROVAL",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "admin"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "status", "value": "PENDING_APPROVAL" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"items expose deleted state\", () => { const j = pm.response.json(); for (const it of j.items) { pm.expect(it).to.have.property('deleted'); pm.expect(it).to.have.property('deletedAt'); } });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Approve Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminJwt}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/admin/{{productId}}/approve",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "admin", "{{productId}}", "approve"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"status APPROVED\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"APPROVED\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Reject Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminJwt}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Price above allowed margin\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/admin/{{productId}}/reject",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "admin", "{{productId}}", "reject"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"status REJECTED\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"REJECTED\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
